title: D1_NL_01_Isla_Arrive
---
// Walter is already seated and waiting when Isla walks in
<<Walter Enter 1>>
<<Walter Neutral>>
<<wait 2>>

<<Isla Enter 2>>
<<Switch_Camera CamController Char2Cam>>
<<Isla Happy>>

Isla: [wave]Good evening.[/wave] #line:08a0c84 
<<Walter Look R>>
<<Walter Happy>>
Walter: Good evening, Isla. Didn't expect to see you out this late. #line:07177af 
<<Isla Look L>>
Isla: I could say the same to you, Mr. Walter. #line:091f3ef 
Walter: [wiggle]The TV can wait one night.[/wiggle] #line:04b4b12 
<<Walter Look F>>
<<Isla Look F>>
<<Walter Neutral>>

Isla: Oh, this place is new, isn't it? I don't think I've walked by here before. #line:0c72231 
Player: Good evening. Yeah, I just opened up a few days ago. #line:096a42b 
<<Isla Neutral>>
Isla: Well, it looks lovely. Mind if I take a seat? #line:0563db4 
Player: Of course, make yourself comfortable. #line:0aedce9 
-> Rough day? #line:0b85232 
    Player: You look like you've had a long one. #line:030fc29 
    Isla: [wiggle]Is it that obvious?[/wiggle] Just got off a shift. #line:01a687f 
-> First time here? #line:0530637 
    Player: First time in the neighborhood? #line:0f291f0 
    Isla: Something like that. I just never noticed this spot before. #line:0ffeea2 
-> Take your time. #line:034b2a6 
    Player: Take your time, no rush tonight. #line:0cce3e8 
    Isla: [wave]Thanks, I appreciate that.[/wave] #line:060eba6 
-> Welcome in.  #line:00c0f06 
    Player: Welcome in, glad to have you. #line:048873e 
    Isla: [wave]Glad to be here.[/wave] #line:0050673 

Isla: I'm Isla, by the way. #line:0a5fc65 
Isla: I'm a nurse over at the local clinic, just down the road. #line:03b741d 
Player: Nice to meet you, Isla. I bet that job keeps you busy. #line:029dcc3 
Isla: [wiggle]You have no idea.[/wiggle] #line:08aad1b 
Player: Well, you're in the right place to unwind. What can I get you? #line:0a11a50 
Isla: Do you have anything to recommend? #line:03a9b11 
<<jump D1_NL_02_Isla_Order>>
===

title: D1_NL_02_Isla_Order
---
Player: [swing]Everything is recommended here.[/swing] #line:0ccc814 
Isla: Umm... #line:08b55b0 
<<order_customer "[CocktailSystem]" Isla>>
Isla: Okay, I'll have [order] {Order_Cocktail_ByName_OutName("Cranberry Fizz")} [/order]. #line:0e14474 
Player: Got it. #line:09c73bd 

<<Isla Neutral>>

<<flow_prepare_drinks>>

<<wait_for_task SystemGame>>

//After Isla's order
<<Switch_Camera CamController Char2Cam>>

<<if $satisfaction == Satisfaction.Perfect>>
    <<Isla Happy>>
    Isla: [bounce]Oh, wow... this is incredible.[/bounce] #line:098cc49 
    Isla: [rainb]Seriously, you have magic hands.[/rainb] #line:0b57f5f 

<<elseif $satisfaction == Satisfaction.Acceptable>>
    Isla: Oh, it tastes... a bit different from what I expected. #line:095bf12 
    Isla: But it's fine. #line:05bcc69 

<<elseif $satisfaction == Satisfaction.Fail>>
    <<Isla Sad>>
    Isla: [shake]Uh... Bartender?[/shake] #line:03b9d20 
    Isla: I think you might have grabbed the wrong bottle. #line:0dcdeb1 
    Isla: It's definitely not what I asked for. #line:058f740 

<<endif>>

<<Reset_Variable SystemGame>>

<<Isla Neutral>>
<<jump D1_NL_03_Isla_Talk>>
===

title: D1_NL_03_Isla_Talk
---
Isla: Did you just move here? #line:08f6c19 
Player: Yes, just a few days ago. #line:03ed3e2 
Isla: It's a nice little town, once you get used to the quiet. #line:0debc0f 
Isla: Actually, I'm not from around here either. #line:0d7171a 
Isla: I was transferred here for work. #line:08c70ea 
Player: How long have you been here? #line:0ef2fdb 
<<Isla Happy>>
Isla: [wiggle]Long enough to stop counting.[/wiggle] #line:034e155 
Isla: I just... ended up staying longer than I planned. #line:015bf6b 
Player: Sounds like this town has a way of doing that. #line:00dda3b 
Isla: [wave]Maybe it does.[/wave] #line:07b2d83 
