Owen: I thought I knew everyone in town. #line:0750053 
Owen: Since when did this place have a bartender? #line:04e9866 
-> Hello! #line:0479aec 
    Player: Hello. I'm a Bartender. #line:00746d3 
    Player: I just opened a few days ago. #line:0aa30c2 
    <<Isla Happy>>
    Owen: Newcomer? Glad to see you. #line:08c8720 
-> Just the bartender. #line:0c9dc16 
    Player: Just the bartender. #line:0cae804 
    Owen: [swing]Just the bartender? No name, no story?[/swing] #line:0cd9875 
    Owen: Mysterious. I like it. #line:01bde74 
-> Hey! Hey!! #line:0982fe0 
    Player: hey! Hey!! Bartender here! #line:064e91f 
    <<Isla Happy>>
    Owen: [bounce]Now that's the spirit![/bounce] #line:0bd4724 
-> Good evening. #line:096c587 
