    <<Isla Neutral>>
    Owen: [wiggle]Whoa, so formal. I'm speechless.[/wiggle] #line:057d3f5 
    Owen: Nice to meet you. #line:073eca7 

Owen: Well, you picked the right town to open a bar. #line:0d17f8c 
Owen: Looks like I've finally got a regular spot. #line:0cd3b23 
<<Isla Look R>>
Isla: [wiggle]You show up everywhere, Owen.[/wiggle] #line:069cb2e 
<<Owen Look L>>
Owen: I'm easy-going. I'm fine with anywhere. #line:02def58 
