title: D1_NL_06_Owen_Talk
---
Owen: Anyway. #line:0f6bf15 
Owen: I didn't tell you what I do for a living, did I? #line:0a0d429 
Owen: Guess what I do for a living. #line:00fe5a9 
Owen: The hint is nature. #line:09f72ff 
-> Gardener #line:0a21dd5 
    Owen: [wiggle]Nope. Do I look like that?[/wiggle] #line:0e6cc16 
-> Lumberjack #line:0ed04b9 
    Owen: [shake]The opposite![/shake] #line:09543c4 
-> Wildlife conservationist #line:051b06d 
    Owen: [bounce]Close! You're actually the first person to get that close.[/bounce] #line:0e53b57 
-> You have a job? #line:0b24cc2 
    Owen: [shake]Hey! What's that supposed to mean?[/shake] #line:014dff8 

Owen: I'm a forest ranger. #line:00c2f16 
Owen: I take care of the forests and the wildlife. #line:0bed875 
<<Owen Look L>>
Owen: You got closer than Isla ever did. #line:0d35166 
Owen: First time we met, she thought I was homeless. #line:09cb174 
<<Isla Look R>>

<<Switch_Camera CamController Char23Cam>>

Isla: [shake a=2]It's because you were climbing a tree behind my dorm![/shake] #line:0b0d64b 
Isla: And you looked all scruffy. #line:0509316 
Owen: Because I climbed up to catch the raccoon. #line:0e467fc 
Isla: [shake]Then you fell off the tree. I was shocked.[/shake] #line:049d711 
Owen: Luckily, it wasn't anything serious. #line:0806441 
<<Owen Happy>>
Isla: Your ankle sprained. #line:07698b6 
